  {
    "episode_id": 51127,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/1/51127.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "So you're sort of closing in on your first term as a senator. And you kind of came in and built a reputation as being kind of a deal maker, kind of being able to work with the Republican Party. Was that your goal when you first came to Washington?",
