        "text": "After being assigned to the banking committee, I made regulatory relief for small lending institutions a top priority.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "During my job interview process, I repeatedly heard concerns about Dodd-Frank regulations negatively impacting small financial institutions.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Dodd-Frank regulations were perceived as making it difficult for small banks to survive.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The intended purpose of Dodd-Frank—preventing 'too big to fail'—has resulted in 'too small to succeed'.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      {
        "text": "The speaker’s role on the banking committee gives them influence over regulatory policy changes.",
        "confidence": 0.95
