      {
        "text": "Small financial institutions in North Dakota face significant operational challenges due to Dodd-Frank regulations.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Relationship banking is valuable and worth preserving as a model within the national financial system.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Regulatory relief would help preserve relationship-based banking practices in the U.S.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Audience members believe that economic hardship among small institutions is a legitimate concern requiring legislative action.",
        "confidence": 0.89
