        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes the listener had a significant personal insight related to their political role.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The timing of realizations is relevant to evaluating the speaker's judgment of the listener's preparedness or authenticity.",
