    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/1/51127.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "So we have this regulatory relief bill that was signed by President Trump. Talk to me a little bit about the negotiations and how that came about. I know people largely credit Chairman Crapo, yourself, John Tester, and Mark Warner and Joe Donnelly. Were there any other key players involved in sort of crafting that regulatory package?",
