    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/1/51127.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 12,
    "turn_text": "And it's hard to know. I think we see the Fed doing some things unilaterally that I think could be helpful. But I just ask people, when you have various entities, regulators, interpreting the same rule, there isn't the same level of accountability. And so I'll let other people basically criticize that. But I am somebody who believes that we need a single regulator for Volcker.",
