    "turn_idx": 18,
    "turn_text": "I think that there's always a danger for legislators to try and seek relief. outside of the legislative process, because none of that creates a level of permanency. And so without talking about the various merits, I will tell you that I think that these are issues that you shouldn't do workarounds on legislation.",
