    "turn_idx": 19,
    "turn_text": "Many Republicans in the House felt like they wanted to see more out of the regulatory relief bill, and they've sort of put together this Jobs Act 3.0 bill. I'm curious to know about your thoughts on this bill, whether this is something you'd support.",
