    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/1/51127.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 24,
    "turn_text": "Are you optimistic that the Majority Leader Mitch McConnell would give this floor time? I know Jeb Hensrling in the House has said that he's got a promise from the Senate Majority Leader. However, there is sort of a tight calendar between having to get a budget passed as well as midterm elections coming. What are your thoughts on that?",
