    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/1/51127.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 30,
    "turn_text": "There is another nominee coming up in that Brett Kavanaugh for the Supreme Court. Considering his past rulings on Chevron and the CFPB, are you concerned about his addition to the court and whether that would threaten the agency's constitutionality?",
