    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/1/51127.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 50,
    "turn_text": "Obviously, Wells Fargo has been under a lot of scrutiny for the fake accounts. And now more recently, there was sort of a technical software error that I know Brian Schatz has brought up that led to about 400 people getting foreclosed on their homes. What do you think the banking committee needs to do more in terms of oversight of Wells Fargo?",
