      },
      {
        "text": "Repeated assurances like 'we're on it' are insufficient without action.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "This culture contributed to current organizational challenges.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Blaming individual employees does not absolve institutional responsibility.",
